Roccella Italian Restaurant Bundoora is an all day Italian venue located in Bundoora VIC 3083 and inspired by the food we grew up eating in the homeland. Their warm and inviting atmosphere is perfect for a casual meal with friends and family, or a special occasion with a loved one. They pride ourselves in providing you with exceptional service and a memorable dining experience, true southern Italian hospitality.

Roccella Italian Restaurant Bundoora is now looking for an experienced Trade Waiter to join their team.

The right candidate will be responsible for:

Supervision, training and coordination of FOH employees;
Taking orders and reservations from clients;
Cleaning tables after services and setting tables for new customers;
Arranging tables on the restaurant;
Welcoming clients and taking them to their table;
Serving dishes and drinks;
Recommending special dishes and wines according to menu availability and selection;
Serving water and drinks;
Collecting payments after service;
Ensuring customers enjoy their dining experience;

About you:

At least 1 year of experience as a Trade Waiter;
Ability to work well under pressure;
Ability to serve clients effectively and efficiently;
Excellent interpersonal skills;
Excellent customer service;

Job type: Permanent/full-time
Salary: $76,000 - $82,000
